    q=0.40  run  20  strict>=20 OK    ~20(+/-1) OK   | min share 0.100 OK   | eligible yes
    q=0.45  run  19  strict>=20 FAIL  ~20(+/-1) OK   | min share 0.139 OK   | eligible yes
    q=0.50  run  19  strict>=20 FAIL  ~20(+/-1) OK   | min share 0.187 OK   | eligible yes
